-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022","text":"使道寶步出魏興，分軍泝墊江，俱會晉壽。太祖以文弘背叛，進廣香為持節、都督西秦州刺史。廣香子北部鎮將軍郡事炅為征虜將軍、武都太守。以難當正胤楊後起為持節、寧朔將軍、平羌校尉、北秦州刺史、武都王，鎮武興，即文弘從兄子也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":55,"last_line":55,"raw_start":3960,"raw_end":4068,"raw_character_offsets":[3960,3961,3962,3963,3964,3965,3966,3967,3968,3969,3970,3971,3972,3973,3974,3975,3976,3977,3978,3979,3980,3981,3982,3983,3984,3985,3986,3987,3988,3989,3990,3991,3992,3993,3994,3995,3996,3997,3998,3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023,4024,4025,4026,4027,4028,4029,4030,4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,4043,4044,4045,4046,4047,4048,4049,4050,4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067],"revision_id":1748911},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"道寶","kind":"person","person_id":"g7a_bhl_ta9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"文弘","kind":"person","person_id":"zdb_1c5_ffp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"廣香","kind":"person","person_id":"rdb_pcr_z28","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"廣香","kind":"person","person_id":"rdb_pcr_z28","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"炅","kind":"person","person_id":"sl2_clv_v9l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"難當","kind":"person","person_id":"g2n_d4n_mzr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"楊後起","kind":"person","person_id":"gxd_sho_nx7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"文弘","kind":"person","person_id":"zdb_1c5_ffp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p023","text":"三年，文弘歸降，復以為征西將軍、北秦州刺史。先是廣香病死，氐眾半奔文弘，半詣梁州刺史崔慧景。文弘遣從子後起進據白水。白水居晉壽上流，西接涪界，東帶益路，北連陰平、茄蘆，為形勝之地。晉壽太守楊公則啟經略之宜，上答曰：「文弘罪不可恕，事中政應且加恩耳。卿若能襲破白水，必加厚賞。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":57,"last_line":57,"raw_start":4070,"raw_end":4208,"raw_character_offsets":[4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4082,4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,4088,4089,4090,4091,4092,4093,4094,4095,4096,4097,4098,4099,4100,4101,4102,4103,4104,4105,4106,4107,4108,4109,4110,4111,4112,4113,4114,4115,4116,4117,4118,4119,4120,4121,4122,4123,4124,4125,4126,4127,4128,4129,4130,4131,4132,4133,4134,4135,4136,4137,4138,4139,4140,4141,4142,4143,4144,4145,4146,4147,4148,4149,4150,4151,4152,4153,4154,4155,4156,4157,4158,4159,4160,4161,4162,4163,4164,4165,4166,4167,4168,4169,4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175,4176,4177,4178,4179,4180,4181,4182,4183,4184,4185,4186,4187,4188,4189,4190,4191,4192,4193,4194,4195,4196,4197,4198,4199,4200,4201,4202,4203,4204,4205,4206,4207],"revision_id":1748911},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p023:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"文弘","kind":"person","person_id":"zdb_1c5_ffp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p023:m0024","s